           <img src=\"https://userimg-assets.customeriomail.com/images/client-env-187419/01M1PY4JCQHRRWFKP89YGKY3JR.gif\" width=\"450\" alt=\"Watch CodeRabbit in action\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid #e4e1d9;border-radius:8px;\">\r\n                          </a>\r\n\r\n                          <br>\r\n\r\n                          <a href=\"https://e.customeriomail.\" style=\"font-size:14px;color:#ff5a1f;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\r\n                            Watch demos\r\n                          </a>\r\n                        </td>\r\n                      </tr>\r\n                    </tbody></table>\r\n\r\n                    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;margin:0 0 20px;background:#f7f6f3;border:1px solid #e4e1d9;border-radius:8px;\">\r\n                      <tbody><tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"padding:18px;color:#111111;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">\r\n\r\n                          <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-weight:700;\">\r\n                           Security Review at the moment it matters\r\n\r\n                          </p>\r\n\r\n                          <p class=\"body-copy\" style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;\">\r\n                          Every PR is checked for exposed secrets, vulnerable code, dependency risks, and infrastructure issues, keeping security in the workflow as your codebase changes.\r\n                          </p>\r\n                        </td>\r\n                      </tr>\r\n                    </tbody></table>\r\n\r\n                    <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin:0 auto 18px;\">\r\n                      <tbody><tr>\r\n                        <td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ff5a1f\" style=\"border-radius:8px;mso-padding-alt